WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.669 --> 00:00:04.920
In this video, we are bringing you the first
official stills for the HBO’s upcoming Game

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:10.200
of Thrones prequel series House of the Dragon
which is about a Targaryen civil war known

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:17.220
as the Dance of the Dragons that tore Westeros
apart over 100 years before the original series.

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:21.560
Although production on House of the Dragon
is still very much in progress, audience is

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:25.970
getting a gift with official images of the
series’ main characters.

00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:29.500
Here are some close-up shots of its main characters.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:35.570
First up, we have the Sea Snake himself, actor
Steve Toussaint as Lord CorlysVelaryon with

00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:37.030
silver dreadlocks.

00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:42.129
This series is about a Targaryen civil war
that breaks out when King Viserys dies and

00:00:42.129 --> 00:00:46.420
his children Rhaenyra and Aegon start a war
for the Iron Throne.

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:51.269
Both claimants to the Iron Throne have allies
and the most prominent on Rhaenyra’s side

00:00:51.269 --> 00:00:56.359
is Corlys Velaryon, the head of an ancient
Valyrian house with a powerful navy.

00:00:56.359 --> 00:01:01.659
Velaryons had for centuries remained the oldest
and closest allies of the Targaryens

00:01:01.659 --> 00:01:05.880
and in this war, they chose to fight for Rhaenyra.

00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:10.610
During the Conquest, it was Velaryon ships
that carried Aegon’s soldiers across Blackwater

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:14.960
Bay, and later formed the greater part of
the royal fleet.

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:19.299
The most famous and strongest Velaryion to
ever live is also one of the main characters

00:01:19.299 --> 00:01:24.759
in the upcoming House of the Dragon show - CorlysVelaryon,
known as the Sea Snake.

00:01:24.759 --> 00:01:31.060
He is a fabled Lord of the Tides during Targaryen
civil war, Master of Driftmark, and head of

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:32.720
House Velaryon.

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:38.439
House Velaryon, much like House Targaryen,
is of Valyrian descent, and its members often

00:01:38.439 --> 00:01:44.509
have Valyrian features, such as silver hair,
purple eyes, but their skin is different because,

00:01:44.509 --> 00:01:49.020
unlike Targaryens, they have married outside
their own family.

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:54.950
The Sea Snake is the husband of Princess Rhaenys
Targaryen, the Queen-Who-Never-Was, King Viserys'

00:01:54.950 --> 00:01:58.380
cousin who especially loves Rhaenyra.

00:01:58.380 --> 00:02:03.490
During the Dance of the Dragons, Corlys becomes
Hand to Queen Rhaenyra Targaryen who is his

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:07.130
niece and daughter in law as she marries his
son.

00:02:07.130 --> 00:02:12.000
Sea Snake's life before the Dance of the Dragons
was just as exciting.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:17.379
As matter of fact, he is getting his own Game
of Thrones Prequel show named „9 Voyages“.

00:02:17.379 --> 00:02:23.280
Corlys is also a good friend of Rhaenyra’s
uncle-soon-to become- husband Prince Daemon.

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:27.850
Lord Corlys and his fleets fought alongside
Prince Daemon Targaryen during the War for

00:02:27.850 --> 00:02:28.950
the Stepstones.

00:02:28.950 --> 00:02:34.489
When Daemon declared himself the King of the
Stepstones and the Narrow Sea, Corlys placed

00:02:34.489 --> 00:02:37.150
the crown on the new king's head.

00:02:37.150 --> 00:02:41.940
Lord Corlys Velaryon sits on the black council
during the civil war known as the Dance of

00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:47.150
the Dragons; he is the greatest lord to pledge
his strength to the cause of Queen Rhaenyra

00:02:47.150 --> 00:02:52.910
Targaryen, who was opposed by her half-brother,
King Aegon II Targaryen.

00:02:52.910 --> 00:02:57.640
More than half of Rhaenyra's army is made
up of men sworn to House Velaryon.

00:02:57.640 --> 00:03:01.310
Corlys's fleet also gives the blacks superiority
at sea.

00:03:01.310 --> 00:03:06.349
When Lord Bartimos Celtigar pressured the
princess to fly from Dragonstone to King’s

00:03:06.349 --> 00:03:12.120
Landing at once and reduce the city to ash
and bone with her dragon, Corlys demanded

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:17.459
to know how that would serve them, telling
him "we want to rule the city, not burn it

00:03:17.459 --> 00:03:21.430
to the ground", which tells you much and more
about his character.

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:26.430
Later in the story Corlys even saves most
of the great families of Westeros by sending

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:33.049
envoys to the Lannisters, Baratheons and Hightowers,
who had been Aegon II's main supporters, suing

00:03:33.049 --> 00:03:39.310
for peace, preventing the Wolf of Winterfell,
Cregan Stark from marching on them as he wanted

00:03:39.310 --> 00:03:42.930
to continue the war until all Rhaenyra's enemies
were destroyed.

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:47.489
Corlys is going to be one of your favorite
characters in House of the Dragon.

00:03:47.489 --> 00:03:52.510
From Queen Rhaenyra's allies we go to her
enemies, Queen Alicent and her father Ser

00:03:52.510 --> 00:03:53.659
Otto Hightower.

00:03:53.659 --> 00:03:59.350
Rhaenyra is the chosen heir of her father
King Viserys, and totally expects to be queen

00:03:59.350 --> 00:04:00.750
when he dies.

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:06.739
But as all good plans, this one fails as well
because she has a rival in the form of her

00:04:06.739 --> 00:04:12.189
dad’s second wife Alicent Hightower and
her father Otto Hightower, the Hand of the

00:04:12.189 --> 00:04:13.219
King.

00:04:13.219 --> 00:04:19.020
Instead of Rhaenyra, they prefer that Alicent’s
first son by the king, Aegon Targaryen, take

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:22.060
the Iron Throne when King Viserys passes.

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:27.130
Alicent is of course wearing a green dress,
the color of her house and of her factions

00:04:27.130 --> 00:04:33.010
that support her son Aegon while her father
Otto is wearing the Hand of the king pin as

00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:38.770
at this time King Viserys is still alive and
he is his hand, although he held that same

00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:43.500
position before King Viserys and will wear
it after him.

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:48.470
Alicent Hightower is a member of House Hightower
who becomes the second wife to King Viserys

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:53.170
I Targaryen and therefore a Queen of the Targaryen
dynasty.

00:04:53.170 --> 00:04:58.180
She is the daughter of Ser Otto Hightower,
who had been Hand of the King to Jaehaerys

00:04:58.180 --> 00:05:03.210
I, Viserys I, and later his grandson Aegon
II.

00:05:03.210 --> 00:05:09.610
She is the mother of King Aegon II, Queen
Helaena, Prince Aemond, and Prince Daeron.

00:05:09.610 --> 00:05:14.680
Alicent Hightower is in many ways the true
leader of Aegon II's faction during the Dance

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:16.610
of the Dragons.

00:05:16.610 --> 00:05:21.450
Alicent's father Otto Hightower had been Hand
of the King in the last few years of the long

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:24.380
reign of King Jaehaerys I Targaryen.

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:30.010
In 101 AC Otto brought the young Alicent to
the royal court, where she cared for the aging

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:31.010
king.

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:36.400
Jaehaerys eventually died in 103 AC, while
Alicent was reading to him and was succeeded

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:41.870
by his grandson Viserys I.
Alicent stayed at court, as her father continued

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:49.150
to occupy the position as Hand under Jaehaerys's
grandson and successor, King Viserys I Targaryen.

00:05:49.150 --> 00:05:53.280
Already early in the reign of Viserys, Ser
Otto and Prince Daemon Targaryen were at odds

00:05:53.280 --> 00:05:57.130
with each other, and the court fool Mushroom
has suggested that the quarrel between the

00:05:57.130 --> 00:06:00.410
two men began when Daemon deflowered Alicent.

00:06:00.410 --> 00:06:03.170
The truths of these tales have never been
uncovered.

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:08.050
Viserys I's first queen, Aemma Arryn, only
produced one living child before her death

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:10.300
- a daughter, Rhaenyra.

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:15.470
In the years that followed, Alicent caught
the eye of King Viserys I Targaryen, and Viserys

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:17.650
choose Alicent as his second wife.

00:06:17.650 --> 00:06:22.930
They married in 106 AC, despite the whispers
of people who believed that the Hand had risen

00:06:22.930 --> 00:06:24.430
above himself.

00:06:24.430 --> 00:06:28.960
Some doubted Alicent's virtue, as rumors began
circling that she had given her maidenhead

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:34.000
to Prince Daemon, and had later even slept
with King Viserys while Queen Aemma was still

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:35.000
alive.

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:41.220
The notorious Mushroom suggested that Alicent
had been intimate with the late Jaehaerys

00:06:41.220 --> 00:06:42.220
as well.

00:06:42.220 --> 00:06:43.750
Nonetheless, Alicent was wed to Viserys.

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:48.620
At first young Rhaenyra and Alicent got along
well, but a rift grew between them as soon

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:53.880
as Alicent produced her own children for Viserys
I, and clearly wanted them to succeed to the

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:56.060
throne instead of her.

00:06:56.060 --> 00:07:02.680
Alicent bore Viserys I four children: Aegon
II, Aemond One-Eye, Daeron the Daring, and

00:07:02.680 --> 00:07:05.970
Helaena (who became the sister-wife of Aegon
II).

00:07:05.970 --> 00:07:11.900
Over the years of Viserys I's reign, despite
his best efforts, a bitter rivalry grew between

00:07:11.900 --> 00:07:17.470
Alicent and Rhaenyra at court, as well as
between their rival factions of supporters.

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:22.990
In 111 AC, a great tourney was held at King's
Landing on the fifth anniversary of the king’s

00:07:22.990 --> 00:07:24.200
marriage to Queen Alicent.

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:29.160
At the opening feast, Alicent wore a green
gown, whilst Princess Rhaenyra dressed in

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:30.830
Targaryen red and black.

00:07:30.830 --> 00:07:35.970
Soon afterward, their respective followers
started dressing in similar colors and styles

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:41.240
to display their political allegiance: Rhaenyra's
faction (the "Princess's followers") wore

00:07:41.240 --> 00:07:46.560
black clothing, and Alicent's faction ("the
Queen's followers") wore green clothing .

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:51.360
Ultimately this inspired the nicknames for
the two factions: "the Blacks and the Greens".

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:56.780
The Blacks (Rhaenyra's supporters) included
the Starks, Tullys, Arryns, Tarlys, and Velaryons

00:07:56.780 --> 00:08:01.270
(among others), while the Greens (Alicent's
supporters) included the Hightowersand the

00:08:01.270 --> 00:08:03.670
Lannisters, among others.

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:08.490
The Baratheons started out as Blacks but switched
to the Greens when the civil war began, while

00:08:08.490 --> 00:08:13.840
the Tyrells may have been Greens at first
but during the civil war itself declared themselves

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:14.840
neutral.

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:19.900
Viserys I publicly and repeatedly made the
great lords of the realm swear oaths that

00:08:19.900 --> 00:08:24.100
Rhaenyra would succeed him on the Iron Throne,
as the first Ruling Queen.

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:30.180
But when he dies, his wife Alicent and his
Hand, Ser Otto will be the first to support

00:08:30.180 --> 00:08:36.819
Aegon II who is their own kin and not only
support but stage a coup.

00:08:36.819 --> 00:08:42.050
Last but not least we have this close-up shot
of Rhaenyra and Daemon Targaryen themselves,

00:08:42.050 --> 00:08:45.029
the two key figures of this series.

00:08:45.029 --> 00:08:50.780
Daemon is a younger brother of King Viserys
I Targaryen, while Rhaenyra is his daughter.

00:08:50.780 --> 00:08:54.630
That makes them uncle and niece, who will
eventually also become husband and wife as

00:08:54.630 --> 00:09:00.710
well because this is the Game of Thrones universe
and they are the true Targaryens after all.

00:09:00.710 --> 00:09:04.959
Let me know in the comments down below if
you like the dragon scales on Daemon’s arms

00:09:04.959 --> 00:09:06.910
and Rhaenyra’s dress.

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:11.379
Rhaenyra Targaryen,
King Viserys’ chosen heir, a dragon rider

00:09:11.379 --> 00:09:23.410
who grew up expecting to become the first
ruling Queen of Westeros.

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:28.420
Princess Rhaenyra Targaryen, cheered as the
Realm's Delight when she was young and later

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:34.730
called the Half-Year Queen, was the first-born
child of King Viserys I Targaryen.

00:09:34.730 --> 00:09:40.620
Rhaenyra was King Viserys I's only living
child by his first wife, Queen Aemma of House

00:09:40.620 --> 00:09:41.850
Arryn.

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:47.790
At the age of eight, she was made her father's
heir and grew up expecting to become the first

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:49.550
ruling Queen of Westeros.

00:09:49.550 --> 00:09:53.310
Rhaenyra was a dragonrider whose mount was
Syrax.

00:09:53.310 --> 00:09:59.339
Rhaenyra had her family's Valyrian looks,
wearing her silver-gold hair in a long braid

00:09:59.339 --> 00:10:03.080
in the manner of Queen Visenya Targaryen.

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:08.019
Beautiful as a child, Rhaenyra was later declared
by her uncle, later husband and the man who

00:10:08.019 --> 00:10:13.680
is standing beside her in these pictures,
Prince Daemon Targaryen, to be the most beautiful

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:16.319
maiden in all the Seven Kingdoms.

00:10:16.319 --> 00:10:21.569
Daemon Targaryen is also a key figure from
this time period and is George R.R. Martin's

00:10:21.569 --> 00:10:23.560
favorite Targaryen.

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:29.930
Daemon was the most controversial man of his
lifetime, an audacious rogue prince and adventure

00:10:29.930 --> 00:10:33.490
who seemed made of good and evil in equal
measure.

00:10:33.490 --> 00:10:38.860
There was never a man so loved and so reviled,
and at the same time, as he was.

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:43.770
During the Dance of the Dragons, as the husband
of his niece Rhaenyra, he supported his wife's

00:10:43.770 --> 00:10:48.540
claim, and he was considered by many the most
dangerous man in Westeros.

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:54.089
At the time of her father's death, Rhaenyra
was on Dragonstone awaiting the birth of her

00:10:54.089 --> 00:10:55.240
child.

00:10:55.240 --> 00:11:00.079
The greens in King's Landing ensured that
the news of the Viserys's death did not reach

00:11:00.079 --> 00:11:06.330
her until her own supporters in the Red Keep
were dead or imprisoned and Aegon II's coronation

00:11:06.330 --> 00:11:07.740
had already occurred.

00:11:07.740 --> 00:11:13.610
This began a devastating civil war that tore
apart the Seven Kingdoms, known as The Dance

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:18.220
of the Dragons, as it was the only war in
which both sides had dragonriders.

00:11:18.220 --> 00:11:23.730
There you have it guys, first official stills
for the upcoming Game of Thrones prequel series,

00:11:23.730 --> 00:11:27.250
House of the Dragon that will air in 2022.

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:28.560
Stay tuned for more.

00:11:28.560 --> 00:11:32.250
I hope you guys enjoyed this video and if
you did please give it a big thumbs up and

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:33.250
I hope to see you in the next one.

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:33.251
Peace!

